WEBVTT

00:04:59.273 --> 00:05:02.432
and shown us worlds
that we might have missed.

00:05:03.043 --> 00:05:06.956
So as technology keeps moving
faster and faster,

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:09.116
I am good with something slower.

00:05:09.562 --> 00:05:13.216
My finger beneath the words
has led me to a life of writing books

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.636
for people of all ages,

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.500
books meant to be read slowly,

00:05:17.524 --> 00:05:19.008
to be savored.

00:05:19.805 --> 00:05:23.508
My love for looking deeply
and closely at the world,

00:05:23.532 --> 00:05:26.799
for putting my whole self into it,
and by doing so,

00:05:26.823 --> 00:05:30.403
seeing the many, many
possibilities of a narrative,